SUMMARY:Relief Printmaking with Heather Hogan
DESCRIPTION:Relief Printmaking with Heather Hogan in Davis \nSunday\, August 9 | 10 AM – 1:30 PM \n$115 Members\, $125 Non-Members (All materials included) \n  \nWith artist Heather Hogan\, students will learn how to design for relief printing\, transfer the design to the block\, use various types of ink\, and create single prints and repeating patterns on paper and fabric. Paper\, cards\, flour-sack towels\, and drawstring pouches will be provided\, but students are encouraged to bring multiple garments and fabrics to print upon. Tips and techniques for collaging paper prints and securing fabric printed patches to garments will be discussed. This class is open to both beginners and experienced artists and is recommended for ages 12 and up. \n  \nRegister here: https://pencegallery.org/education/programs/workshops-and-classes/ \n  \nAny questions? Email pencegallery@gmail.com.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/relief-printmaking-with-heather-hogan/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Heather-Hogan-copy.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
